    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="33.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 33.1a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf híne hwá forstande, beo hig begen anes rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone interposes in his defence, they shall both incur the same punishment.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gif hine hwa forene forstande, beon hi begen anes rihtes wyrðe.</ab>
      </div>
